# Primary inference config lives in the repo-root compute.env (see ../COMPUTE.md):
#   NEBIUS_API_KEY=...          base inference key
#   OPENROUTER_API_KEY=...      REQUIRED for these notebooks' closed default models
#                               (openai/gpt-4o-2024-08-06 for Cournot, openai/gpt-3.5-turbo
#                                for Bertrand). Switch MODEL_SPEC to an open model to skip it.
#
# This local .env is for per-project overrides. It is ALSO the easiest way to satisfy the
# first cell's `assert os.getenv('OPENROUTER_API_KEY')`, which runs before llm_config loads
# the repo-root compute.env. Copy this file to .env and uncomment the line below, or export
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY in your shell before launching Jupyter.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
